{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_05_809269815#0_1250469494","relevance":1,"reason":"The document is about the history and popularity of salsa dance/music in the United States, but it says Latin music domination 'never stopped' rather than explaining why salsa was not noticed in America.","learned":"Some general salsa-history pages frame salsa as brought to the U.S. by visiting musicians after Cuban popularity, but they do not address lack of notice."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ salsa music america (+ \"language barrier\" \"english-speaking\" \"mainstream audience\"))","reason":"Search for a concrete explanatory factor often cited for why salsa or Latin music did not gain mainstream U.S. notice: language and English-speaking audience barriers."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ salsa music america (+ \"language barrier\" \"english-speaking\" \"mainstream audience\"))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_29_1339915970#1_3046917358","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2447","rank":1,"snippet":"Rodríguez Orejuela Gilberto Rodríguez Orejuela José Santacruz Londoño Helmer Herrera \" , \"segment\": \"Cali, like every city that is respected has its particularities. All have urban spaces populated by cement, asphalt, smog, old town, squares, climates, customs. This is so special that it has been cataloged as the world capital of salsa. The <cover>salsa is identified as a rhythm of the Caribbean Sea basin. That space of the world that goes from Key West in the United States, Gulf of Veracruz in Mexico, Central America, the Antilles, islands of the English-speaking Caribbean until arriving at the South Caribbean of the Venezuelan coasts. All very far from Cali. Cali other than being the origin of a criminal organization that in the nineties made shake the foundations of Colombian society is known for multiple events such as fairs, carnivals, music </cover>festivals, as well as other sports, scientific and business. Contents [ hide] 1 Members of The Cali Cartel 2 ¿How was the Cali Cartel created? 3 The Philosophy of the Cali Cartel 4 ¿How was the Cali Cartel Structured? 5 ¿How Was the Money Laundered by the Cali Cartel?\" , \"start_char\": 282."}}
